{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Grip your steering wheel and join your favorite Banban characters in the race of a lifetime! Drift around tight corners and zoom through locations both old and new. Use power-ups and boosts to dodge your opponents and claim first place!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Race with Friends!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248310/extras/36f24afa555986b5946e7ccf777b2bd5.poster.avif?t=1764564302\" width=560 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248310/extras/36f24afa555986b5946e7ccf777b2bd5.webm?t=1764564302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248310/extras/36f24afa555986b5946e7ccf777b2bd5.mp4?t=1764564302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as your favorite Banban characters, each with their own unique features!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race alone, or with other players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Speed\u2019s the Game!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248310/extras/bb2c9c19f6b8647f111559397b3fdb57.poster.avif?t=1764564302\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248310/extras/bb2c9c19f6b8647f111559397b3fdb57.webm?t=1764564302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248310/extras/bb2c9c19f6b8647f111559397b3fdb57.mp4?t=1764564302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drift well and often to earn invaluable speed boosts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the shortest route and beat your opponents to the finish line!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Anything to Get Ahead!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248310/extras/cf484dac18cc4437d7f5f3e7d6646202.poster.avif?t=1764564302\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248310/extras/cf484dac18cc4437d7f5f3e7d6646202.webm?t=1764564302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248310/extras/cf484dac18cc4437d7f5f3e7d6646202.mp4?t=1764564302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time your jumps to avoid obstacles or find hidden shortcuts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use items to sabotage the opposition!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3248310?t=1764564302","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3248310?t=1764564302","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248310/e0e09288d2d4ba97316f9a06b9664c791f4aebde/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764564302","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248310/e0e09288d2d4ba97316f9a06b9664c791f4aebde/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764564302","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},